check 1
# Census: pets, the maximum and group eviction (sim/pets.md §1-§7, §10): a
# necromancer with Raise Skeleton at 1 raises from four corpses in a row;
# the pet cap (skeleton count) evicts the oldest. Blood Moor, no population.
# State and rng channels.
name sys-pets-skeletons
save ScnNec --class nec --expansion --level 30 --skill 0=1 --right-skill 70
seed 1234
ticks 220
seconds 400
channels state rng packets
ignore q
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 179 @x+4 @y normal
at 10 poke spawn 179 @x+5 @y+2 normal
at 10 poke spawn 179 @x+5 @y-2 normal
at 10 poke spawn 179 @x+6 @y normal
input frame 20; rclick 544 336; frame 60; rclick 544 336; frame 100; rclick 544 336; frame 140; rclick 544 336
